Image Denoise (Apache License 2.0) and oneTBB (Apache
License 2.0); their license files are in the folder oidn-license of each package.

Ultra Fractal and FractInt are named only to describe file formats RFract reads. No formula
files of either program are part of RFract. See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for all bundled
third-party material and its license texts.
